  "overview": {
    "description": "Truc is a 15th-century bluffing trick-taking game from France and Spain. Players get 3 cards and try to win 2 of 3 tricks. NO TRUMP and NO suit obligation â€” highest card wins regardless of suit (7 is highest in French version). Equal cards spoil the trick. Major bluffing component: players can propose to raise stakes at any point.",
